OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells in the evening. Cloud
OL,7,Fwill increase from the late evening
OL,8,Fand outbreaks of light rain or drizzle
OL,9,Fwill spread east towards morning.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FMainly dry and cloudy, some
OL,12,Fbrighter spells possible along in the
OL,13,Feast. Rain will spread east later in
OL,14,Fthe afternoon and evening. Warm in any
OL,15,Fbrightness in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
