OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FShowers, some heavy and thundery
OL,7,FTuesday. These clear for a time
OL,8,FWednesday. A band of heavy rain pushes
OL,9,Fsoutheast Wednesday night, turning
OL,10,Fshowery Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
